{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "eba07fd4-a671-4de1-b3db-366da45443a0",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "9182fcff-9871-43fe-812d-65f363380173",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1018",
            "content": {
                "en": "Ah… Veris! Over here.",
                "zh": "啊......以真！这边。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 69.33332824707031,
            "positionY": 120.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "77c5dc93-0be0-40fd-b88e-e20ed0a96f04",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "066100ef-5e3a-4a3f-8313-9da8c2998323",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1019",
            "content": {
                "en": "!",
                "zh": "！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 404.0,
            "positionY": 121.33332824707031,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9770f865-01ab-4c52-bc27-cf810934f02b",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1020",
            "content": {
                "en": "Noema, long time no see…",
                "zh": "梦之，好久不见……",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 741.3333740234375,
            "positionY": 128.6666717529297,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b2b2bc19-d800-4e83-b2ae-5bee5592599a",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "5c2350da-c9c0-447f-8406-60bff21a53f5",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1021",
            "content": {
                "en": "Long time no see! Seeing that you’re alright is such a relief.",
                "zh": "好久不见！看到你没事，我总算放心了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1081.333251953125,
            "positionY": 132.6666717529297,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "23fd413e-e66e-4905-8246-06f3b759dbe6",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1022",
            "content": {
                "en": "Oh? You saw the news too?",
                "zh": "诶？你也看到新闻了？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1426.0,
            "positionY": 132.6666717529297,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "14cea158-93e6-436b-ba9a-6724e0a8ec2f",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "7324b771-f6f5-4d90-b605-0ae0697e44d9",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1023",
            "content": {
                "en": "Yeah. I just heard that the flight to Yuntai went missing, and I immediately thought of you... Good thing you made it here safely.",
                "zh": "嗯。刚刚听说那架飞来芸台的航班失联了，我一下就想到你……还好你平安到了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1764.0,
            "positionY": 134.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "1595e599-e651-44c0-8e41-f5c623017219",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1024",
            "content": {
                "en": "Noema, actually, I—",
                "zh": "梦之，其实我——",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2103.33349609375,
            "positionY": 133.3333282470703,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "ce6f3c62-52ef-445c-8059-593674a2ef8d",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "5c2350da-c9c0-447f-8406-60bff21a53f5",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1025",
            "content": {
                "en": "We’ve only just met again after so long. There’s no need to talk about that right away.",
                "zh": "好不容易见面，先不急着说这些。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2840.666748046875,
            "positionY": 130.6666717529297,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f9b17698-b6d4-4040-b59d-83a654ae0364",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "5c2350da-c9c0-447f-8406-60bff21a53f5",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1028",
            "content": {
                "en": "You only just got here yesterday, you must be exhausted. Did you get a good rest last night?",
                "zh": "你昨天刚到，一定很累吧？昨晚休息得还好吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3176.666748046875,
            "positionY": 131.3333282470703,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f5bc51cd-ef6d-452d-9b1a-1e1586bd97be",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "9bf1f67d-ba62-4b57-a9cc-3ce252972f0f",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1029",
            "content": {
                "en": "I’m alright. It’s just that what happened yesterday was really strange. I was going to tell you—",
                "zh": "我还好。只是昨天发生的事，实在有点奇怪，我本来想跟你说——",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3512.0,
            "positionY": 133.3333282470703,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "777afcf0-b1b9-475c-84ce-92b9ffc7c25f",
            "index": 13,
            "characterId": "7dce9553-65bb-400b-9970-de7217fdd43d",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1024a",
            "content": {
                "en": "Before Veris could continue, Noema quickly picked up the conversation.",
                "zh": "何以真刚开口，沈梦之便很快把话接了过去。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2478.666748046875,
            "positionY": 130.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "86c1a916-1b6a-4a92-9c30-cad937d32e3a",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "7324b771-f6f5-4d90-b605-0ae0697e44d9",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1030",
            "content": {
                "en": "Haha, let’s not talk about that while standing at the entrance.",
                "zh": "哈哈，别站在入口聊这些了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4220.0,
            "positionY": 132.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "58951cfc-8ac4-4a49-9dda-04ddc69c5ecc",
            "index": 11,
            "characterId": "5c2350da-c9c0-447f-8406-60bff21a53f5",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1031",
            "content": {
                "en": "Let me take you around the festival first. There are plenty of interesting stalls at the Qiqiao Festival.",
                "zh": "我先带你去会场里转转吧，乞巧大会上有很多有趣的摊位呢。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4601.3330078125,
            "positionY": 128.6666717529297,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "71f572e0-2cd2-40f8-b5c9-17c09200c69a",
            "index": 12,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_1032",
            "content": {
                "en": "Okay. Oh, by the way, I…",
                "zh": "好。对了，我......",
                "ja": ""
            },
